{"articleNo":"63789","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=63789&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 하반기 공채대비 전공별 취업캠프 참가자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.04","hit":"4983","attachments":[{"name":"전공별 취업캠프 참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=63789&attachNo=70659"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">취업경쟁력 향상 프로젝트 「</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">전공별 취업캠프</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">」</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오공과대학교 취업준비생들의 취업경쟁력 강화를 통해 대기업 및 일반기업 취업성공률을 높이고자 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2012년 하반기 공채 대비 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">전공별 취업캠프</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">를 실시하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 캠프일정 : 2012년 8월 ~ 10월 중 전공별 교육실시(무박 2일)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 모집인원 : 각 전공별 선착순 40명</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 참가신청 : <font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>학과사무실 문의</strong> </font>후 <strong>참가신청서</strong> 제출</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 교육장소 : 든사람 교육센터, 청운대, 학과 지정 교육장</font></span></p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 참가대상 : 학부 재학생(전 학년 가능, 고학년 우선 선발)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"22\" valign=\"center\" width=\"210\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">학과명</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"22\" valign=\"center\" width=\"80\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">